    "body": "Advances the matching `.main.commit` and `3rdparty/Megatron-LM` pins from `1e3c0c62fbb79c26d083f506f7da46f5f7add49e` to `07046cc6b8b7479ba05e6b47ed25f3f8e6634573` ([upstream comparison](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/compare/1e3c0c62fbb79c26d083f506f7da46f5f7add49e...07046cc6b8b7479ba05e6b47ed25f3f8e6634573)).\n\nThe six upstream commits include MTP acceptance argmax reuse from TE cross entropy (#8143), dev CI cuBLAS updates, upstream test changes, and maintenance metadata. No Bridge compatibility edits are required by inspection. `.dev.commit`, Bridge dependency metadata, and `uv.lock` are unchanged; no Bridge tests are quarantined or weakened.\n\nValidation: Linux/CUDA container `uv lock` and `uv lock --check` passed (345 packages, no delta); all-file pre-commit, `git diff --check`, matching main pins and unchanged dev pin passed. Requested CI: standard gates and L0 only on H100 and GB200. All requested gates passed on `2138708998f0fb09ca28b587b3dcb599bf866424`: CICD NeMo [38620771316](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/actions/runs/38620771316) attempt 1, four unit jobs, 30 H100 and 12 GB200 L0 jobs; configure confirms L1/L2 disabled. Build/release, installation, copyright, docs preview, secrets, links and status checks passed. Automatically merged through the authorized pin-only merge helper.\n",
    "changed_files": 2,
